» · № 9","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/6b/Marugoto_angel_twins.png/revision/latest?cb=20200929145738"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/6a/6a6badd30b1d4fe51a56.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiUniAngelMonsterBanner.jpg","caption":"Tamagotchi Uni Баннер с объявлением «Ангел и монстр»"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:ButtamageTenshitchi23_EnjoyingShavedIce.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/63/ButtamageTenshitchi23_EnjoyingShavedIce.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20250119030210","caption":"Появление в Anime TV de Hakken!! Tamagotchi","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/63/ButtamageTenshitchi23_EnjoyingShavedIce.png/revision/latest?cb=20250119030210"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:KPTOT65_TwinAngels.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/6d/KPTOT65_TwinAngels.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20250503045306","caption":"Внешний вид добрый и вежливый! Официальная тренировка Tenshitchi","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/6d/KPTOT65_TwinAngels.png/revision/latest?cb=20250503045306"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:KPTOT66_TwinAngelsSad.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e4/KPTOT66_TwinAngelsSad.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20250503045327","caption":"Twin Angels грустит","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e4/KPTOT66_TwinAngelsSad.png/revision/latest?cb=20250503045327"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:KPTOT67_TwinAngelsPray.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f9/KPTOT67_TwinAngelsPray.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20250503045349","caption":"Из альбома «Twin Angels» · № 14","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f9/KPTOT67_TwinAngelsPray.png/revision/la